comments/2884215802","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106312#issuecomment-2884215802","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106312","id":2884215802,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r6aP6","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T15:19:21Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T15:19:21Z","body":"> I just tested some more functions of Projection, and I'm seeing weird results. It seems like between 4.4 and 4.5, both get_z_far and get_pixels_per_meter have changed. In 4.4, get_z_far returns a negative, but in 4.5 it returns a positive. And in 4.4, get_pixels_per_meter(100) returns 86, but in 4.5 it returns -733 (keep in mind that I'm using the same default camera in both versions). I don't think either of these changes were intentional, so it might be worth creating a new issue for that.\n\nWe did change these functions recently in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100209\n\nCC @Flarkk ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884215802/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884235511","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106312#issuecomment-2884235511","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106312","id":2884235511,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r6fD3","user":{"login":"DevPoodle","id":102482062,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhvAjg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102482062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle","html_url":"https://github.com/DevPoodle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T15:25:20Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T15:25:20Z","body":"I just attached an MRP that prints out all the relevant functions. If you open it in 4.4 and 4.5 you should get the results I've described. For now, I'll revert the most recent commit on my PR, just in case it ends up being changed before 4.5.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884235511/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"mi